A column-0 line after an unclosed fence in a description in an item leaves the list

````
- :: t
  : ```
    a
z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
      <dd>
        <pre><code>a
</code></pre>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>z</p>
````

